+# GodSpeed AI glossary map
+
+Start with the vocabulary of the context that owns the concept. CognitiveOS owns the navigation ontology. DomainForge and CEP own their declared semantic and exchange contracts. A product may realize part of that ontology, carry a reference into another context, or supply evidence for a later judgment.
+
+## Contexts
+
+| Context | Language and authority |
+| --- | --- |
+| CognitiveOS and organizational doctrine | [GodSpeed and CognitiveOS glossary](new_world/glossary.md), [canonical document set](new_world/README.md), [CognitiveOS source theory](world/cognitive_os_manifesto_v17.md), [mathematical specification draft](world/cognitiveos_math_layer_v2_3.md), and [Purposeful Case Navigation and OCS](<new_world/Purposeful Case Navigation and the Observer–Case–Settlement Model.md>) |
+| DomainForge semantic modeling | [DomainForge](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/DomainForge), root `GLOSSARY.md` and the [SEA application contract](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/DomainForge/blob/35c4ed1/docs/reference/sea-application-contract.md). The applicable `.sea` source declares a particular domain’s meaning. |
+| CEP exchange semantics | [CEP](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/canonical-evaluation-protocol), root `GLOSSARY.md`, ontology, evidence and settlement specs, and the [GodSpeed profiles](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/canonical-evaluation-protocol/blob/5111ec3/spec/profiles/GODSPEED-PROFILES-v1.md) |
+| Horizon navigation | [Horizon](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/Horizon), `docs/glossary.md`, the frozen HORIZON-001 ruler, and its `.sea` interaction model |
+| Cognate execution | [Cognate](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/Cognate), root `GLOSSARY.md`, runtime API and execution contracts. SEA-Forge authors the Case Assignment contract that Cognate implements. |
+| Cognate Workbench expert and local candidate work | [Cognate Workbench](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/Cognate-Workbench), `docs/glossary.md` and `.sea/interaction/interaction-model.sea` |
+| Gauntlet controlled execution | [Gauntlet](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/Gauntlet), root `GLOSSARY.md` and `.agents/specs/Core-spec.md` |
+| SEA-Forge managed work and authority | [SEA-Forge](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/SEA-Forge), `docs/reference/terminology.md` and its minimum, full and CEP world-binding specs |
+| RealityTrace observation | [RealityTrace](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/RealityTrace), root `GLOSSARY.md` and observation/evidence contracts. `sxr` names the executable and local checkout. |
+| Context Kernel retrieval | [Context Kernel](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/Context-Kernel), root `GLOSSARY.md` and the `ck-core` contracts |
+| SWE_SEED work qualification | [SWE_SEED](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/swe_seed), `.agent-harness/memory/glossary.md`, seed specification and applicable proof contracts |
+| GodSpeed-Agent development | [GodSpeed-Agent](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/GodSpeed-Agent), root `GLOSSARY.md` and developmental event and memory contracts |
+
+Repository links identify the owner. Glossary paths are relative to that repository, including when worktrees or branches use other names. Compass holds an earlier doctrine projection. Read its versioned material as historical where it differs from the [canonical document set](new_world/README.md).
+
+## Relationships
+
+- **CognitiveOS → Horizon.** Horizon projects a purposeful case into the current decision and its assessed choices.
+- **DomainForge → CEP → consumers.** CEP carries DomainForge semantic identity and profile-specific meaning across product boundaries. Consumers maintain their own execution, projection, and evidence identities.
+- **Horizon and SEA-Forge → Cognate Workbench and Cognate.** Handoffs can carry a case reference and, when bound by the case authority, a Case Assignment. Workbench Expert Assignments own Expert work and can reference that case-bound obligation.
+- **Workbench and Gauntlet → RealityTrace and SEA-Forge.** Execution can yield observations and evidence. Acceptance or settlement is scoped to the criteria and authority that issued it.
+- **Context Kernel → navigation and execution.** Citations supply context to a decision or run. Retrieval access and authority to act have separate owners.
+- **SWE_SEED → SEA-Forge → GodSpeed-Agent.** Proof qualification can support an operational ruling. Developmental interpretation and capability promotion require their own evidence and judgment.
+
+Read the [semantic concordance](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/SEA-Forge/blob/main/.agents/reports/2026-11-20-godspeed-domain-modeling/semantic-concordance.md) for equivalences and mappings, the [convergence ledger](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/SEA-Forge/blob/main/.agents/reports/2026-11-20-godspeed-domain-modeling/semantic-convergence-ledger.md) for canonical naming and drift, and the [workflow handoff](https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/SEA-Forge/blob/main/.agents/reports/2026-11-20-godspeed-domain-modeling/workflow-handoff.md) before specifying implementation.
